{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"平\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"平\",\n    \"concise\": \"平\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：Y的大块能独立交代人物此刻的处境、原因和心理转折，前后串联也更完整；X的大字多是孤立词组，部分因果和叙事关系需要依靠小字恢复。small：Y的小字基本是可选的感受补充，不读也不影响主线，且大多能对应当屏情境；X未放大的叙事文字承担了不少主干连接工作，部分感受还偏向描述声音本身。core：平，两版都完整呈现了从试探亲近、害怕失去、重新确认到不再隐藏的过程，也都明确写出了幸福与失去感交织的核心；concise：平，X有较多额外的叙事和声音描写，Y则有一些同屏感受比喻重复解释相近体验，整体简洁度差距不明显。human：X略好，Y有「滑进桥洞般清澈」「痛快地发烫」「直逼下一次冲击」等具体搭配不自然或偏书面的问题；fine：Y更好，身体、呼吸、温度、触碰等体验更具体，X有不少长颤音、琶音、声线等对声音本身的描述；load：X更好，大字短而集中，虽然数量不少，但单屏实际需要扫过的字数少，Y在S01、S05等短停留屏幕上仍有多个较长的大块。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f7bd5628-737a-49d5-87fa-0c9a27e41d0f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T224841077515Z", "elapsed_seconds": 244.828, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T22:52:45.916107+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b5848c82026223297423bc96fbbb55e5c00defd165625f886ff37bfec90dd2f6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_